Error [E0721]: untrusted (`@Tainted`) data reaches `process.run` without being sanitized
  --> tests/ui/taint_sink_unsanitized.jet:8:23
    |
  8 |     result := process.run(["echo", name]) ?? return
    |                       ^^^
 Why: `process.run` runs a subprocess command — a `Exec` sink; a `@Tainted` value used there unchecked is the classic injection bug
 Fix: pass the value through a `@Sanitizer fn` first — its result is trusted, so it may reach the sink
